Description: A toolkit for users of varied coding experience to build custom AI chatbots 
             as R6 objects. Users may create or supply APIs, R tool functions or AI prompts that 
             integrate with existing LLM providers like 'ellmer' (Wickham et al., 2025, <https://ellmer.tidyverse.org>). 
             ChatRBox emphasizes modular tool registration and API integration, and may be employed 
             to create agents that automate tasks, optimize existing workflows or underpin AI pipelines.
